# Third-party reference implementation (MIT, Favoni et al. 2012.12901). Only the
# L-CNN layer code is tracked — scripts/bench_lcnn_reference.py loads
# lge_cnn/nn/layers.py by path, so the V100 gets it with a pull instead of an
# scp. The fixed-point-action checkpoints (4 × 3.1 MB), the HMC code and the
# conda environments are not needed here and stay out of the repo.
lge-cnn-master/*
!lge-cnn-master/lge_cnn/
!lge-cnn-master/LICENSE
!lge-cnn-master/README.md
